amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/51d75e54d19acaae2464bf18da21631f.avif?t=1791771029\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/c64d4ff6bfee3e98182f276aea8abf4c.poster.avif?t=1791771029\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/c64d4ff6bfee3e98182f276aea8abf4c.webm?t=1791771029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/c64d4ff6bfee3e98182f276aea8abf4c.mp4?t=1791771029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每一隻伊莫都會根據棲息地、天氣、培養方式和成長路線不同，進化出各式各樣的分支型態。無論是充滿夏日氣息的沙灘型態，還是神祕的潮濕型態；熱情天使茸、高冷女巫草、宅宅埋埋草，物種生態驚喜連連！豐富的型態圖鑑等你來解鎖，親手打造你的專屬莫百科！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/6581f9e4d887264fd46a2c2a1058ac76.avif?t=1791771029\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/ca1ddeabd0d85243bc3543f03fa6a62b.poster.avif?t=1791771029\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/ca1ddeabd0d85243bc3543f03fa6a62b.webm?t=1791771029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/ca1ddeabd0d85243bc3543f03fa6a62b.mp4?t=1791771029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >或是蓬松的绒毛，或是坚硬的铠甲……逼真的材质、丰富的动作表现，让你穿透屏幕，抚摸生命的灵动。羞羞獭抱铲猛冲、焚火狼静坐火旁、花芽蟹明明强壮却胆小。不经意间展现的小动作和反差正是他们迷人又可爱的地方！当它们敲敲屏幕，那是向你撒娇的信号！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/414b1156d8ff2c07274f6107e87e9683.avif?t=1791771029\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/15ebd412810e55832ec553d9a8d35815.poster.avif?t=1791771029\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/15ebd412810e55832ec553d9a8d35815.webm?t=1791771029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/15ebd412810e55832ec553d9a8d35815.mp4?t=1791771029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在艾德爾大陸上，每個伊莫種族都有專屬的生存之道與部族傳說。從自然交響到群落互動，每個角落都藏著設計巧思。隨著旅程推進，更多動人故事將在指尖綻放，讓你的每一次探險都充滿情感厚度！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/33ebbf95a4cd8d0e1f90f264f399532e.avif?t=1791771029\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/392af28562f43273f151148ddd8b464c.poster.avif?t=1791771029\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/392af28562f43273f151148ddd8b464c.webm?t=1791771029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/392af28562f43273f151148ddd8b464c.mp4?t=1791771029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >體驗最暢快的即時制自由捉寵戰鬥！無論是背後突襲、連續投擲還是戰術奇襲，捕捉方式由你定義。每次丟出謎立方的瞬間都充滿驚喜；全新「搶蛋大作戰」玩法更是充滿刺激，與好友組隊偷稀有伊莫蛋、和對手鬥智鬥勇，在策略博弈和運氣之間，享受極限翻盤的快感！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/ddca1057f2752051af20b8d1dc6d3e7f.avif?t=1791771029\" width=1560 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/b650d0f3615772433dbf1ef0d56d3d95.poster.avif?t=1791771029\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/b650d0f3615772433dbf1ef0d56d3d95.webm?t=1791771029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126040/extras/b650d0f3615772433dbf1ef0d56d3d95.mp4?t=1791771029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每位冒險家都可以打造專屬自己的露營車，能停靠在營地中與其他冒險家交流。在家園中還能和伊莫一起種田、建造與布置夢想空間。旋轉木馬磨坊、摩天輪紡車等趣味裝置，將生產與遊玩完美結合。快在好友與伊莫的超強助攻下，打造出最溫暖的歡樂樂園吧！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※本遊戲內容涉性(僅部分角色穿著凸顯性特徵服飾)及暴力(人物打鬥或未描述角色傷亡細節之攻擊等而無血腥畫面)，依遊戲軟體分級管理辦法分類為輔導12級，十二歲以上之人始得使用。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ※本遊戲為免費遊戲，但遊戲內另提供購買虛擬遊戲幣、物品等付費服務，請依個人興趣及能力進行適度消費。 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※請注意遊戲時間，避免沉迷，長時間進行遊戲，容易影響作息，宜適度休息及運動。 ※本遊戲台灣地區由艾瑞爾網路股份有限公司代理，如有疑問，請以本遊戲客服管道聯繫。</p>",
   "short_description": "《伊莫》是一款全新型態的多人連線大世界捉寵RPG。你將踏上遼闊的艾德爾大陸，與各種不可思議的神奇生物「伊莫」奇妙邂逅。透過獨特的連結系統，你將能和牠們合體、繼承強大能力，以全新的視角探索世界。此外，還能前往充滿科技感的浮空都市，與來自各地的冒險家交流、競技，譜寫你的旅程日記。快帶著夥伴伊莫，展開一場超越想像的奇幻冒險吧！",
   "supported_languages": "英文<strong>*</strong>, 簡體中文<strong>*</strong>, 日文<strong>*</strong>, 繁體中文, 韓文<strong>*</strong>, 法文, 德文, 俄文, 印尼語, 泰文, 葡萄牙文 - 巴西, 西班牙文 - 拉丁美洲, 越南文<br><strong>*</strong>具備完整音效支援的語言",
